duties or responsibilities that are required of the employee for this job. Duties, responsibilities and activities may change at any time with or without notice. Lakeland University does not offer H-1B or other work authorization visa sponsorship for this position. Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the United States at the time or hire and maintain work authorization throughout the employment term. If you have questions regarding this, please contact Human Resources. Lakeland University is an Equal Opportunity Employer/Educator."
